TAIN BODY OF INFORMATION TRY RAC FIRST MAYBE A RULE I THINK FIND TURNING IS BETWEEN 10 TO 100X MORE WORK THAN FINE TUNING. ONLY IF YOU SURE TO GO FOR IT AND THEN IT CAN BE VERY POWERFUL. LAST I WANT TO COVER IS A PRA", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=4360", "end": 4480.14, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "20a427b2703652b606c40f9d58e59602f6804f12d0f5948497975b2c9edea53c", "start": 4360.689, "text": "IT TURNS OUT THAT PATIENT INTAKE MAYBE EASIER THAN EVEN READING X-RAYS AND THERE'S OFTEN NOT THE FIRST PICTURE THAT POPS IN YOUR HEAD WHICH IS ACTUALLY THE BEST AUTOMATION OPPORTUNITY WHAT DO LAWYERS DO A MENTAL PICTURE FROM TV AS LAWYERS S", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=5852", "end": 5971.76, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "fa277ae1112ded9b5ce8d3690d3c60973254230e2f68cbdc224ffa35b7d172fe", "start": 5852.079, "text": "LASTLY, I THINK THERE IS A GOLDEN AGING OF AI APPLICATION BUILDING SO YOU TAKE RESPONSE SERIOUSLY BUT EVEN AS THEY KEEP ON EVOLVING WE WILL LEARN ABOUT IT AND GO OUT TO BUILD STUFF FOR OTHERS IF YOUR FIRST PROJECTS DON'T WORK OUT OR HARM OT", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "Developer Marketing", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=0", "end": 119.79, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4aca5d7410434edf756e1362574e752af7293c45a74cb3346c0cc42c414a03b6", "start": 0.0, "text": "Welcome to this NeurIPS tutorial on application development using LLMs. Both EASET OpenAI as well Deep Learning AI Fund have had the privilege of working with many people building large language model applications and so we hope To share so", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=1612", "end": 1732.559, "evidence_kind":